'''HAPPI''' is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Kaohsiung Rapid Transit Collaboration Event]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = HAPPI
|image = E 465.png
|appearance = [[Kaohsiung Rapid Transit Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 400元 - 1,580元
}}

==Enemy==
HAPPI can be considered a weaker version of [[Brollow]] with [[Knockback|knockback]] and [[Omni Strike]].

==Strategy==
Use attackers and meatshields. Not much trouble to deal with it.

